{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_normal_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_normal_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "D1F1D51ED872AF88",
      "text": "You already faced me during the Elite Test, so...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_02",
      "hash64": "D1F1D81ED872B4A1",
      "text": "I doubt this will leave much of an impression\\non you. In any case, let’s get started, shall we?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_03",
      "hash64": "D1F1D71ED872B2EE",
      "text": "I’ll be facing you in my role as a Gym Leader,\\nso I’m going to use my regular team.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "D1F1DA1ED872B807",
      "text": "They all belong to the Normal type.\\c\\n“Normal” as in plain...average...unremarkable...\\nrun-of-the-mill...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "D1F1D91ED872B654",
      "text": "I’m pretty fond of them, you know? They suit me\\nperfectly—I’m about as ordinary as you can get.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_06",
      "hash64": "D1F1DC1ED872BB6D",
      "text": "People, Pokémon... There’s no need to\\novercomplicate things.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_07",
      "hash64": "D1F1DB1ED872B9BA",
      "text": "Nowadays people only seem to want a shock\\nfactor. Something weird, something bizarre.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_08",
      "hash64": "D1F1CE1ED872A3A3",
      "text": "At the end of the day, though, nothing beats the\\nrelief of coming home, even after a fun vacation.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_09",
      "hash64": "D1F1CD1ED872A1F0",
      "text": "When all’s said and done, simplicity is strongest.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_10",
      "hash64": "D1EE501ED86F97B2",
      "text": "You’re a bit too much for an average joe like me\\nto handle...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_11",
      "hash64": "D1EE511ED86F9965",
      "text": "But I think I understand now.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_12",
      "hash64": "D1EE4E1ED86F944C",
      "text": "Why I was told to use Flying types when I battle\\nas a member of the Elite Four, I mean.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_13",
      "hash64": "D1EE4F1ED86F95FF",
      "text": "There’s scenery you’ll never even notice if you\\nstick to flat, well-trodden paths.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_14",
      "hash64": "D1EE4C1ED86F90E6",
      "text": "It’ll do me good to admire talent that soars as\\nhigh as yours from time to time.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_15",
      "hash64": "D1EE4D1ED86F9299",
      "text": "Well, if the boss says I should do so, I’ll do so.\\nShe won’t catch me doing it for fun, though.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_16",
      "hash64": "D1EE4A1ED86F8D80",
      "text": "In any case, I’ve been strictly told to cut down on\\nmy overtime hours, so...I’ll call it a day.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
